  unitName: Wildcat Lindsey
  unitId: 30655
  unitNumber: 1062
  description: A warrior from another world guided by the Chain Chronicle. Her lynx-like
    footing along with her colorful knife allow her to cut through large numbers
    of enemies, opening a path in their midst in the blink of an eye as they all
    fall around her. Lindsey is also very skilled in taunting enemies and leading
    them towards traps, which gives her fighting style a lot of flexibility on the
    battlefield. Due to her bright personality, she is considered the mascot of the
    Volunteer Army by her fellow warriors. However, since she never feels nervous
    or under pressure, the pranks she plays on her beloved comrades never cease,
    even during the toughest battles.
  summonDesc: He he he.<br>Nice to meet you, meow!<br>Oh, but hands off meow ears.
  fusionDesc: This world's so fun, meow!<br>I just wanna keep playing<br>all day
    long, meow!
  evoDesc: Thank meow!<br>From now on I'll surprise everyone<br>with more impressive
    stuff, meow!
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
